      "review_description": "I chose Perth Solar warehouse they made everything easy from start to finish.There website was invaluable in not only choosing thr right Solar panels and inverter (REC Alfa Pure R & Fronius Gen 24 6.6kw system) but they also removed any anxiety I had during the selection process.I had a 10 year old 5kw system on the roof that needed to be removed before the new system was installed, they removed the old system replaced broken tiles, and installed the new system in a day, also the panels where placed in a better location on the roof to maximise my Solar power output.The Fronius app connected to the smart meter was all done with help from PSW support team I couldn't be happier, the knowledge gained from the smart meter and Fronius app on power consumption is amazing.I will finish in saying I could not have had the quality system they  installed at the price i paid by any other installer in Perth",
